{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "20f4546de55c573c651593c9cea691a5949f2b248da5f869eae753f0a06d71bb", "ja": "アマリリスの歌", "zh": "孤挺花之歌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6521a5c5e47eeaae1bf49493641b4215bbeb1edc9e1ceda3e7ded0e725eaa56d", "ja": "歌に悩み続けるエミリーに、親身に助言する\n千早。役柄として歌えばいいと理解したエミ\nリーは、千早と美希に嫌われたと思っていた\n自分を恥じる。千早は自分と美希の言葉足ら\nずを謝り、ふたりは笑顔を重ねるのだった。", "zh": "千早亲切地向一直为歌唱苦恼的艾米莉提出建议。艾米\n莉明白了只要以角色身份歌唱即可，为自己曾以为被千早和\n美希讨厌而感到羞愧。千早为自己和美希表达不够充分而道歉，\n两人相视而笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2ff22b68e2e1f82083b8397b94578fce2b05501b527aa63f81e03e71f0be2781", "ja": "（昨日、歌について美希と千早にダメ出しをされた事で\nエミリーはだいぶ悩んでいるようだ。話をしてみるか）", "zh": "（昨天美希和千早指出了艾米莉唱歌时的问题，她似乎相当烦恼。要不要找她聊聊呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "56f9a8d25cbceba798b66c8349788fcea4d1dacdfe29f4b5ebd58bc673c7955b", "ja": "エミリーは、控え室かな……？　青羽さんにも、\n見かけたら声を掛けておいてもらうか。", "zh": "艾米莉是在休息室吗……？也拜托青羽小姐，要是见到她就跟她说一声吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "a1bc4df708a5009190c3b6f6d7d71f5e861f75e0cca7142f29a1cf87d9062ed6", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです、ちょうど良かった。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了，正好遇到您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0dacd77dbbfdde5da4db3d6765d5cd1e0ae0a66fde5d89c6cdbed912f844650b", "ja": "お疲れ様、千早。\nちょうどいいって、何かあったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，千早。\n你说正好，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "6f92cad676480f7f0b9070974464b9ed3b0803170862283dcc6dec04538bde24", "ja": "ええ。昨日のエミリーの歌なんですけど、\nこれを参考にしたらいいんじゃないかと思って……。", "zh": "嗯。关于艾米莉昨天唱的歌，我觉得……可以参考一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "82b8585c9c8d836d6156fcc15ed19ba167f40b67ce189d49e894cbab3c58f437", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、お話があるとうかがったのですが……\nあっ！　ち、千早さん……！", "zh": "制作人先生，我听说您有话要对我说……\n啊！千、千早小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "c2ce792a2ce05b74be0ff4cdd3beb70dafa50b934e73dd62a6f7b288dbba3df1", "ja": "すみません、お話し中だったのですね。\nあの、失礼します。", "zh": "对不起，原来您正在谈话。\n那个，我先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "df29cfc1adb21aabe92942c10f40baab93773a225a3017ba12d8436c858e6fa2", "ja": "待って、エミリー。ちょうど良かったわ。\nこれを渡そうと思っていたの。", "zh": "等等，艾米莉。正好。\n我本来就打算把这个拿给你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "ec64a7a5cfb67d9dd4b1afdb765966a4209d1db377c1d0f0f3fca06ba10076fa", "ja": "えっ……あの、これは？", "zh": "咦……那个，这是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "eca12cd3b0d96e3535829e76f037617cae0edb29d38ac80e0046e316b8806a1a", "ja": "CDを持ってきたの。\n何か参考になるんじゃないかと思って。", "zh": "我带了CD过来。\n想着或许能给你当个参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "4afe9966507d0a62a8b3de5c22c8b59c8ee838a62361f11904199df99d1576bc", "ja": "これは……大和撫子の歌ではないのですね。\n私が、聴いたことのないようなものばかりです……。", "zh": "这……并不是大和抚子的歌曲呢。\n全都是些我从没听过的歌……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "65bcf4f2131f82937b4e72710de08be3d938bfee2d5930e4c3e89363216c2b73", "ja": "歌い方にも、いろいろな種類があるわ。\nウィスパーで歌ったり、つぶやくように歌ったり……。", "zh": "唱法也有很多种。  \n比如用气声唱，或者像低声自语一样唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "62217f43315870fea3b29a7a25cfd819a439498eade62b3a7f253acc9d1adec6", "ja": "昨日の歌で違和感を覚えたのは、歌い方が、\nステージでの歌い方に近かったからじゃないかって。", "zh": "我觉得昨天那首歌让我感到违和，\n可能是因为那种唱法太接近舞台上的唱法了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3dee69a260912220954b5b3da36d17d41b8be8d8f032c628efc09241863ad70c", "ja": "うん……そうだな。ステージで歌う歌と、\nお芝居の歌の歌い方。その違いなのかもしれない。", "zh": "嗯……确实。在舞台上演唱的歌，\n以及戏剧中的演唱方式。可能就是这种区别吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "62296c8774c9104c04a7407a381bbeba18272a8d53933e66b90fc61c4a201c0a", "ja": "舞台上で歌う歌と、お芝居の歌の歌い方……。", "zh": "舞台上演唱的歌曲，和戏剧中歌曲的唱法……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "347ccee47ca8a0341d34999461067ab811e3b02228fd62f2a122d095255e10bc", "ja": "ええ。エミリーはいつも、来てくれたファンの人達を\n楽しませようと、一生懸命歌っているわ。", "zh": "是的。艾米莉总是为了让前来支持的粉丝们开心，而努力地歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "80e9f056e4d646f8715198133bf1d046c0631f509590d6cdb2cfbb82c3d3ef28", "ja": "でも、アマリリスはそうじゃない。\n彼女の歌は美しいけど、歌わされているだけ……。", "zh": "但是，阿玛莉丝并不是这样。她的歌声虽然很美，却只是被迫唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "4ca5a689380f191eb62cfef7cf5a997b185a87e3eb747b83cc6ea3a8d19a58f8", "ja": "あっ……！　そ、そうでした。\nアマリリスが歌っているのは、命じられて……。", "zh": "啊……！对、对了。\n木槿之所以在歌唱，是因为受到了命令……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "3d01a737773dd8da8628c7ee6d569a60824848e0e735dfe36dded7eb437cc042", "ja": "歌うことではなく、アマリリスの気持ちを中心に\n考えれば……きっと、歌い方も変わってくるはず……。", "zh": "如果不是想着唱歌，而是以阿玛莉莉丝的心情为中心去考虑……唱法应该也会随之改变……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "7188334da606b0f7e2db2a2086596dcb6d2567268b398fb6e8c5688c5721d8bc", "ja": "千早さん……。\nあ、あの！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "千早小姐……  \n啊、那个！谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "10c2cfaaba2d492fef5a68cccecaf3541eaa0e2e35a66fea7571b2c1358d0a85", "ja": "少しは役に立てたかしら。\nそれじゃ、私は歌のレッスンがあるから……。", "zh": "能帮上一点忙就好了。\n那我还有声乐课，先走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "0575882603f5690933bff107f6d8125a7336af3dc2274ee38e418ecc2c9a270c", "ja": "あ、あの、待ってください！\nこれ、よかったら……どうぞ！", "zh": "啊、那个，请等一下！\n这个，如果您不嫌弃的话……请收下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "b218e5571351f8a64c580aed31836c7fa2254119dc77b3dc47e49b349c56de3e", "ja": "これは……クッキー？　おいしそう。\nけど、いただいてしまっていいの？", "zh": "这是……饼干？看起来很好吃。  \n不过，我真的可以收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "9ad0f499572074fb4184139ee92cfb4fda8145d4addd063014fcceee0608442c", "ja": "本当は、昨日、差し入れに持ってきたものなんです。\nけど、言い出せなくて……。", "zh": "其实，这是我昨天本来想带来给大家的慰问品。\n可是，一直没能说出口……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "59cb7c0a5182286bfb6e05faba410a8a6d3e7d3357651a1c0bee74f389d72705", "ja": "エミリー……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "3cf09fa877f9048f792bce9dfdc4267ba31b06bebd2f834789fadb8fa27233ad", "ja": "私は、未熟です。上手にできなかった事で、\n千早さんや美希さんに嫌われたと思ってしまって……。", "zh": "我还不成熟。因为有些事情没能做好，\n就以为千早小姐和美希小姐讨厌我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "349de42bde559732e494bb7f8a8febf66e78439c772307e090d94b7d5e8b8685", "ja": "ひとりで、勝手に落ち込んだりして。おふたりとも、\n私が気づかないことを指摘してくださったのに……。", "zh": "总是一个人擅自消沉。明明你们两位还指出了我没有注意到的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "9ea19d1a5ebb109a3668e9f546987ef62e5e71f31c69406c3cf4e38cfa923e8c", "ja": "そうではないわ。私も美希も、言葉が足りなくて……\n不安にさせてしまったのね、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "不是那样。我和美希都没把话说清楚……\n让你感到不安了吧，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "819e37e0c1f0109ef00e381bc91bdb17011d29d122a00eb658632404c56503ad", "ja": "もっと他のみんなのように、\nうまく伝えられるようにならなくてはね。", "zh": "也得像其他人那样，更好地把想法传达出去才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "084fd96b3eed28997af44a36204d6b240323812ec373bc171f6f4d3707cc8906", "ja": "千早さん……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "68fa74e54e2deaadf3e0a000cdee0eba629cdd6af9a9ec6c604870a816e5a4d3", "ja": "美希は何を考えているのかわからないこともあるけど。\n歌い方が何か違うと気づいたのも、あの子だから……。", "zh": "有时我也不知道美希在想些什么。\n但也正因为是那孩子，才能察觉到歌唱方式有些不同……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "875590e0ffdcb03df717f146863dca637e19986dc21773195eea910be606a7ee", "ja": "千早さん……はいっ！\n私、美希さんにも、お礼を申し上げてきます！", "zh": "千早小姐……好的！\n我也要去向美希小姐道谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0106_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0106_story_05_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "a9394436cdcc8142cae5769a117a2640be73159f1ba543fdbe1ddf658c87491f", "ja": "そして、お借りしたこの円盤を聴いて……\nアマリリスとしての歌い方を、つかんでみせます！", "zh": "然后，我会听一听借来的这张唱片……一定会掌握作为阿玛莉莉丝的演唱方式！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
